		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">9</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Which of the following statement is correct about length of the 2D array?
Option-1: Length of 2D array is equal to the number of rows in the array.
Option-2: Length of 2D array is equal to the number of columns in the array.
Option-3: Length of 2D array is equal to the sum of number of rows and number of columns in the array.
Option-4: Length cannot be determined for 2D arrays.</attribute>
