		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">66</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Next step is to convert the algorithm into code.
Note that we have not written even a single line of code until now.
Algorithm design is done on a paper, not in a computer.</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">1278.8543086774555</attribute>
