a. Taking input as an integer (step 1).
b. Displaying output (step 11).
c. Repeating the process for one number at a time (steps 5, 9 and 13).
d. Creating an empty array (step 2).
e. Read space separated numbers as input.(step 3)

We have discussed all of the above in previous assignments multiple times. Take a paper and write the code for our algorithm.</attribute>
